# Desktop (single-machine) build of the web app — loaded by
# `vite build --mode desktop`, i.e. `npm run build:desktop` in `web/`.
#
# The flag below tells `web/src/lib/platform.ts` to drop server-only UI from the
# artifact; today that is the change-password card (see the alias in
# `web/vite.config.ts`).
VITE_SCREENPLAY_TARGET=desktop